"locales."

#: site/pages/about/index.html
#, python-format
msgid ""
"%(site)s is one of the %(network)s sites, which publish the public record of towns and cities "
"every day. The name comes from <cite>Publick Occurrences Both Forreign and Domestick</cite>, the "
"first newspaper in the American colonies. It was printed in Boston in 1690 and shut down after "
"one issue for printing without permission."
msgstr ""
"%(site)s es uno de los sitios de %(network)s, que publican cada día el registro público de "
"pueblos y ciudades. El nombre viene de <cite>Publick Occurrences Both Forreign and "
"Domestick</cite>, el primer periódico de las colonias americanas. Se imprimió en Boston en 1690 y"
" lo cerraron después de un solo número por imprimirse sin permiso."

