#: site/states/ri/schools.html
msgid ""
"What the district spends for each student, from local, state, and federal funds together, as RIDE"
" reports it on its school report cards."
msgstr ""
"Lo que gasta el distrito por cada estudiante, con fondos locales, estatales y federales juntos, "
"según lo informa RIDE en sus informes escolares."

#: site/states/me/schools.html
msgid ""
"What the district spends for each student, from local, state, and federal funds: salaries, "
"benefits, and everything else, at its schools and its central office, as reported under the "
"federal Every Student Succeeds Act. It leaves out construction and debt payments."
msgstr ""
"Lo que gasta el distrito por cada estudiante, con fondos locales, estatales y federales: "
"salarios, beneficios y todo lo demás, en sus escuelas y su oficina central, según se informa bajo"
" la ley federal Every Student Succeeds Act. No incluye construcción ni pago de deudas."

#: site/states/ct/schools.html
msgid ""
"What the district spends on its schools for each student, regular and special education together."
" It leaves out debt, construction, adult education, community services, food services paid for by"
" state or federal funds, and the state's payments to the teachers' retirement fund."
msgstr ""
"Lo que el distrito gasta en sus escuelas por cada estudiante, sumando la educación regular y la "
"especial. No incluye deudas, construcción, educación para adultos, servicios comunitarios, "
"servicios de comida pagados con fondos estatales o federales, ni los pagos del estado al fondo de"
" jubilación de los maestros."

#: site/states/nh/schools.html
msgid ""
"What the district spends to run its schools for each student, from all sources: local, state, and"
" federal. It leaves out construction, debt, transportation, and tuition paid to other districts."
msgstr ""
"Lo que el distrito gasta en operar sus escuelas por cada estudiante, de todas las fuentes: "
"locales, estatales y federales. No incluye construcción, deuda, transporte ni la matrícula pagada"
" a otros distritos."

