"When a city revalues its property, assessed values jump and the rate falls to match, so a lower "
"rate doesn't by itself mean lower bills. Connecticut towns revalue at least every five years."
msgstr ""
"Cuando una ciudad vuelve a tasar sus propiedades, los valores tasados suben de golpe y la tasa "
